──不对，你见过"},{"english":"you don't want to go — yes, I do","chinese":"你不想去──不，我想去"}]},{"id":"yes:o:04b9b738da5d","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示接受建议或给予许可","glossesEn":["accepting offer, giving permission"],"examples":[{"english":"would you like a drink? — yes, please","chinese":"你想喝一杯吗？──好的，请给我来点儿"},{"english":"she always says yes to everything","chinese":"她总是对什么事情都说“行”"},{"english":"dad, can I borrow the car? — yes, but be careful","chinese":"爸爸，我可以借用一下汽车吗？──可以，不过小心点"}]},{"id":"yes:o:30fa1557b35e","label":"int.","definitionZh":"用于询问某人的需求或应答对方的招呼","glossesEn":["asking sb what they want, responding to an address"],"examples":[{"english":"yes? how can I help you?","chinese":"有什么事吗？我能帮你什么忙？"},{"english":"waiter! — yes, sir?","chinese":"服务员！──什么事，先生？"},{"english":"oh, Mr Lawrence — yes, what is it?","chinese":"哦，劳伦斯先生──嗯，什么事？"}]},{"id":"yes:o:198e15ccd375","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示怀疑对方所说的话或鼓励对方说下去","glossesEn":["expressing doubt, encouragement"],"examples":[{"english":"sorry I’m late: the bus didn’t come — oh yes?","chinese":"对不起，我迟到了，公交车没来──哦，真的吗？"},{"english":"I’m going to Paris this weekend — yes?","chinese":"我周末要去巴黎──嗯？"}]},{"id":"yes:o:03126a59bf01","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示刚想起某事","glossesEn":["remembering sth"],"examples":[{"english":"where did I put the keys? oh yes, in my pocket!","chinese":"我把钥匙放在哪儿了呢？哦，对了，在我的口袋里！"}]},{"id":"yes:o:948b563dbbf5","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示强调或表达兴奋激动之情","glossesEn":["expressing emphasis, excitement"],"examples":[{"english":"Mrs Smith has just won £2 million — yes! — £2 million!","chinese":"史密斯夫人刚刚赢了200万英镑──真的！整整200万英镑！"},{"english":"they’ve scored another goal — yes!","chinese":"他们又进了一个球──好极了 ！"}]},{"id":"yes:o:05f9cc5f8fa9","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示不耐烦或气恼","glossesEn":["expressing annoyance"],"examples":[{"english":"hurry up: it’s late — yes, yes, I’m coming","chinese":"快点儿，要迟到了──行了，行了，我就来"}]},{"id":"yes:o:b049aa742bc2","label":"n.","definitionZh":"同意","glossesEn":["answer"],"examples":[{"english":"can’t you give me a straight yes or no?","chinese":"你就不能直截了当地告诉我同意还是不同意？"},{"english":"when we took a vote, there were nine yeses and 3 noes","chinese":"我们进行了一次投票，有9票赞成，3票反对"}]},{"id":"yes:o:5d51802e9ef1","label":"n.","definitionZh":"赞成的人","glossesEn":["person"],"examples":[{"english":"I’ll put you down as a yes","chinese":"我把你看作赞同者"},{"english":"the yeses and the noes","chinese":"赞成者和反对者"}]}]}}}